1
00:00:00,743 --> 00:00:02,977
As Uke comes to strike the center of your head

2
00:00:02,978 --> 00:00:07,247
step in deeply and redirect the strike
in a big circular movement in front of you,

3
00:00:07,648 --> 00:00:09,156
as Uke comes round

4
00:00:09,357 --> 00:00:10,896
position yourself to his rear

5
00:00:10,897 --> 00:00:13,724
entering deeply behind him,
turning the body

6
00:00:13,725 --> 00:00:17,842
as you do so, turn and
place Uke down in front of you.

